# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#   BrainyAi — Environment Configuration Template
#   Copy this file to `.env` and populate with your credentials.
#   NEVER commit your actual `.env` file containing secrets to Git!
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── 1. SERVER & SECURITY ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Port for Flask backend service (default: 5000)
PORT=5000

# Environment mode: 'development' or 'production'
ENVIRONMENT=production
FLASK_ENV=production

# 64-character random hex string for Flask cookie session encryption
# Generate via: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
FLASK_SECRET_KEY=your_64_char_hex_flask_secret_key_here

# 64-character random hex string for HMAC-SHA256 JWT Bearer token authentication
# Generate via: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
AUTH_SECRET_KEY=your_64_char_hex_auth_secret_key_here

# Comma-separated list of allowed frontend origins for CORS and CSRF validation
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://brainyai.app

# ── 2. ADMINISTRATIVE ACCESS & RBAC ─────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of verified admin email addresses
BRAINYAI_ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@example.com

# Comma-separated list of Telegram user IDs with administrative privileges
ADMIN_USER_IDS=123456789

# Comma-separated list of Telegram usernames with administrative privileges (without @)
ADMIN_USERNAMES=adminuser

# ── 3. AI PROVIDER API KEYS ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Groq Cloud API Key (Free high-speed inference: Llama 3.3 70B, Llama 3.1 8B, Qwen 3.8)
# Obtain at: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (Gemini 2.5 Flash, Gemini 2.0 Flash)
# Obtain at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy_your_gemini_api_key_here

# SambaNova Cloud API Key (Llama 3.3 70B, Qwen 2.5 72B)
# Obtain at: https://cloud.sambanova.ai/apis
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=your_sambanova_api_key_here

# Cerebras Inference API Key (Ultra-fast Llama 3.1 8B, Qwen 3.8)
# Obtain at: https://cloud.cerebras.ai/
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=csk-your_cerebras_api_key_here

# OpenRouter API Key (Free tier: Gemma 4 31B, Nemotron 3.5)
# Obtain at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your_openrouter_api_key_here

# Tavily Web Search API Key (Used for real-time web research grounding)
# Obtain at: https://tavily.com/
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-your_tavily_api_key_here

# ── 4. SUPABASE PERSISTENCE & POSTGRESQL ─────────────────────────────
# Supabase project URL and service_role or anon API key
# Obtain at: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_or_anon_key_here

# ── 5. TELEGRAM BOT (OPTIONAL) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Telegram bot token from @BotFather
TELEGRAM_TOKEN=123456789:ABCdefGhIJKlmNoPQRsTUVwxyZ_your_token_here
TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME=BrainyStudyBot

# ── 6. PDF STUDY STUDIO & OCR (OPTIONAL) ─────────────────────────────
# Enable Tesseract OCR fallback for scanned or image-only PDF documents
OCR_ENABLED=true
OCR_LANG=eng
# Path to Tesseract binary (if not in system PATH)
# TESSERACT_CMD=C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe

# ── 7. NEXT.JS FRONTEND CONFIGURATION ────────────────────────────────
# Backend API Base URL for frontend requests
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

# Google Identity Services Client ID for Google Sign-In
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_oauth_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
